{"id":"ai-pair-programming","notes":[{"slug":"Concepts/디버깅-루틴","title":"디버깅 루틴","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T15:07:27+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"감으로 고치지 않기 위한 순서.","links":[]},{"slug":"Concepts/설명-능력","title":"설명 능력 (Communication)","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T15:07:27+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"코드의 모든 줄을 \"왜 이렇게 짰는지\" 한 문장으로 설명할 수 있어야 한다. 설명하지 못하면 이해하지 못한 것 — 그 부분을 AI에게 다시 질문해서 이해를 채운다.","links":["Concepts/AI-프롬프트-기초"]},{"slug":"Concepts/코드-리뷰-체크리스트","title":"코드 리뷰 체크리스트","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T15:07:27+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"AI가 짠 코드든 사람이 짠 코드든 같은 순서로 훑는다.","links":["Concepts/AI-코드-검증"]},{"slug":"Concepts/AI-코드-검증","title":"AI 코드 검증","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T15:07:27+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"AI가 짠 코드는 항상 실행해서 확인한다. 결과만 보고 믿지 않는다.","links":["Concepts/AI-프롬프트-기초"]},{"slug":"Concepts/AI-프롬프트-기초","title":"AI 프롬프트 기초","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T15:07:27+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"이건 Meta 인터뷰 Phase 2(\"핵심 구현\")에서 평가하는 기준과 같다 — 프롬프트를 잘 쓰는 것 자체가 아니라, 결과물을 본인이 통제하고 이해하고 있는지가 핵심.","links":["Concepts/AI-코드-검증"]},{"slug":"decorator","title":"decorator","tags":[],"updated":"2026-10-01T07:24:13.514Z","minutes":2,"excerpt":"데코레이터에 대한 기본 목적, 용도, 사용법 등을 정리하기 위한 문서","links":[]},{"slug":"index","title":"Study","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-16T17:56:47+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"AI 페어 프로그래밍 학습 기록.","links":["MOC","Practice/README","Language/README"]},{"slug":"Language/Python/def","title":"def","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-21T16:42:08+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"파이썬에서의 def가 다른 언어에서와 같이 단순 선어이 아닌 이유를 확인해보고, 정확한 동작 원리를 정리하기 위한문서이다.","links":[]},{"slug":"Language/Python/mutable-object-immutable-object","title":"mutable object immutable object","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T17:38:43+09:00","minutes":2,"excerpt":"파이썬의 객체는 mutable 과 immutable 로 나뉜다.","links":[]},{"slug":"Language/Python/mutalbe-default-argument","title":"mutalbe default argument","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T17:38:43+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"파이썬에서는 function이나 메서드를 선언할 때, 모든 객체가 default value를 선언할 수 있다.","links":[]},{"slug":"Language/README","title":"Language — 언어별 개념 볼트 (계획)","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-16T17:56:47+09:00","minutes":2,"excerpt":"지금은 Concepts/에 언어 무관 개념(디버깅 루틴, 설명 능력 등)만 있고, Practice/는 날짜별 폴더 하나에 모든 언어가 섞여 있다.","links":[]},{"slug":"MOC","title":"MOC — AI 페어 프로그래밍","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T15:07:27+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"이 볼트의 진입점. 개념 노트는 [[]]로 서로 연결하고, 연습 기록은 Practice 폴더에서 관련 개념 노트를 역링크한다.","links":["Concepts/AI-프롬프트-기초","Concepts/AI-코드-검증","Practice/README","Language/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Java/260810-string-equality-bug-java/index","title":"260810-string-equality-bug-java","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.115Z","minutes":3,"excerpt":"상위: Java · Practice","links":["Practice/Java/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Java/260819-integer-division-bug-java/index","title":"260819-integer-division-bug-java","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.115Z","minutes":3,"excerpt":"상위: Java · Practice","links":["Practice/Java/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Java/README","title":"Java","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.108Z","minutes":1,"excerpt":"상위: Practice","links":["Practice/README","Practice/Java/260810-string-equality-bug-java/index","Practice/Java/260819-integer-division-bug-java/index"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260730-closure-bug/index","title":"260730-closure-bug","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.123Z","minutes":2,"excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260730-example/index","title":"260730-example","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.123Z","minutes":1,"excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260730-rate-limiter-bug/index","title":"260730-rate-limiter-bug","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.123Z","minutes":3,"excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260810-shared-list-bug/index","title":"260810-shared-list-bug","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.123Z","minutes":3,"excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260811-iterator-exhaustion-bug/index","title":"260811-iterator-exhaustion-bug","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.123Z","minutes":3,"excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260811-iterator-exhaustion-bug/qna","title":"Q&A — 제너레이터 표현식","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T17:38:43+09:00","minutes":2,"excerpt":"제너레이터 표현식(generator expression). 예약어가 아니라 괄호 문법일 뿐.","links":[]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260812-list-mutation-while-iterating-bug/index","title":"260812-list-mutation-while-iterating-bug","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.132Z","minutes":3,"excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260916-shallow-copy-bug/index","title":"260916-shallow-copy-bug","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.132Z","minutes":5,"excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/README"]},{"slug":"Practice/Python/README","title":"Python","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T06:02:36.115Z","minutes":1,"excerpt":"상위: Practice","links":["Practice/README","Practice/Python/260730-closure-bug/index","Practice/Python/260730-example/index","Practice/Python/260730-rate-limiter-bug/index","Practice/Python/260810-shared-list-bug/index","Practice/Python/260811-iterator-exhaustion-bug/index","Practice/Python/260812-list-mutation-while-iterating-bug/index","Practice/Python/260916-shallow-copy-bug/index"]},{"slug":"Practice/README","title":"연습 기록 규칙","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-16T17:56:47+09:00","minutes":1,"excerpt":"폴더 하나 = 문제/세션 하나.","links":["Practice/Python/README","Practice/Java/README"]}],"tags":{}}